# Kotlin: Kotlin language specification (Kotlin 1.9); requirements/languages/kotlin.md
name     kotlin kt kts

keyword  as break class continue do else for fun if in interface is object package return super this
keyword  throw try typealias typeof val var when while by catch constructor finally import init where
keyword  actual abstract annotation companion const crossinline data enum expect external final infix
keyword  inline inner internal lateinit noinline open operator out override private protected public
keyword  reified sealed suspend tailrec vararg
type     Any Unit Nothing Int Long Short Byte Double Float Boolean Char String Array List Map Set UInt ULong
builtin  true false null println print listOf mutableListOf mapOf mutableMapOf setOf arrayOf require
builtin  check error lazy repeat

line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */  : nested
string   """ """  : multiline interp=dollar
string   " "      : escapes interp=dollar
string   ' '      : escapes
escape        : u4
operators  +-*/%&|!<>=:?
calls
decorators
